<title>USA: Watts names David Bloss president and COO.</title>
<headline>Watts names David Bloss president and COO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH ANDOVER, Mass. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watts Industries Inc said Tuesday that it had named David Bloss president and chief operating officer, a position that has been vacant at the company for the past three years. Bloss had served as executive vice-president since joining the company in 1993.</p>
<p>Company officials were unavailable for further comment.</p>
<p>Watts makes valves for the plumbing and heating, water quality, industrial, steam and oil and gas markets.</p>
